---
config:
  handDrawnSeed: 7
---
classDiagram
    Animal <|-- Duck
    Animal <|-- Fish
    Animal <|-- Zebra
    Animal : +int age
    Animal : +String gender
    Animal: +isMammal()
    Animal: +mate()
    class Duck{
      +String beakColor
      +swim()
      +quack()
    }
    class Fish{
      -int sizeInFeet
      -canEat()
    }
    class Zebra{
      +bool is_wild
      +run()
    }
    Duck --> Pond : lives in
    Fish --> Pond : swims in
    Zebra ..> Savannah
    Pond *-- Water
    Savannah o-- Grass
    Zebra --> Grass : eats
    Water <.. Grass
